# Non-CV prediction outputs — written by model/{forward,inverse}/predict_*.py
# but never read by downstream code (analysis qmds use cv_preds[_summary].csv
# instead). Keep the writers so they can be regenerated for debugging,
# but don't track the outputs.
model/outputs/*/preds.csv
model/outputs/*/preds_full.csv
model/outputs/*/preds_summary.csv

# Raw per-variant prediction tensors saved alongside the CSVs. Large, binary,
# and regenerable from the fit scripts, so they stay local.
model/outputs/*/*.npy

# Legacy data that deliberately left git history (commit 8a348e6): the six
# superseded 4-action/2-action inverse experiments, early pilots, and the
# planning_comm side project. Kept local-only; see data/legacy/README.md.
# The forward-planning and Study 1a pilot CSVs under data/legacy/ remain
# tracked.
data/legacy/*_alt/
data/legacy/*_noalt/
data/legacy/pilots/
data/legacy/planning_comm/

# Non-fitted model-behavior visualizations (parameter sweeps + belief-update
# plots at hand-picked params). Exploratory and not part of the fit pipeline;
# regenerate from the scripts in model/model_viz_nonfit/. Kept local.
model/model_viz_nonfit/

.positai
.claude/worktrees/ 
